<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 19: </span>A successfully resolved specification ambiguity in DafnySynthesis sample #807. The original specification was insufficient, as it only described the behavior for successful outcomes. The ambiguity was resolved by strengthening the post-condition to explicitly define the program’s state in failure cases, ensuring comprehensive and predictable behavior.</figcaption>
