<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 22: </span>A successfully resolved specification ambiguity in DafnySynthesis sample #803, an issue also identified by the Clover. The original post-condition was overly permissive, stating only necessary conditions for the desired outcome. The ambiguity was rectified by strengthening this to a necessary and sufficient condition (an equivalence).</figcaption>
</figure>
